{"id":"b1b899d5ae3caf58","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-binary-halting-undecidability.md","title":"Undecidability of the Halting Languages","display":"thm-halting-undecidable — Undecidability of the Halting Languages","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-binary-halting-undecidability","aliases":["73-thm-binary-halting-undecidability","73-thm-halting-undecidable"],"display":"thm-halting-undecidable — Undecidability of the Halting Languages","depends_on":["[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]","[[73-df-binary-diagonal-halting]]","[[73-df-paired-halting-language]]","[[73-thm-binary-universal-machine]]","[[73-df-binary-program-coding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-binary-halting-undecidability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-binary-halting-undecidability</span><span>73-thm-halting-undecidable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-halting-undecidable — Undecidability of the Halting Languages"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" href=\"?note=004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-decision\">73-df-dtm-language-decision</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b9e8acd6d8438a5d\" href=\"?note=b9e8acd6d8438a5d\" title=\"73-df-binary-diagonal-halting\">73-df-binary-diagonal-halting</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c53aeda03b707867\" href=\"?note=c53aeda03b707867\" title=\"73-df-paired-halting-language\">73-df-paired-halting-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"17b3325184317072\" href=\"?note=17b3325184317072\" title=\"73-thm-binary-universal-machine\">73-thm-binary-universal-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"db96cabedd089e5f\" href=\"?note=db96cabedd089e5f\" title=\"73-df-binary-program-coding\">73-df-binary-program-coding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span> (fixed effective coding)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_{\\mathcal E}\">\\(K_{\\mathcal E}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{HALT}_{\\mathcal E}\">\\(\\mathsf{HALT}_{\\mathcal E}\\)</span> (diagonal and paired halting languages)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf 2}\">\\(\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf 2}\\)</span> (decidable binary languages, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" href=\"?note=004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-decision\">73-df-dtm-language-decision</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}halting\\text{-}undecidable}\\vdash\nK_{\\mathcal E}\\notin\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf 2}\n\\qquad\\land\\qquad\n\\mathsf{HALT}_{\\mathcal E}\\notin\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf 2}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}halting\\text{-}undecidable}\\vdash\nK_{\\mathcal E}\\notin\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf 2}\n\\qquad\\land\\qquad\n\\mathsf{HALT}_{\\mathcal E}\\notin\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf 2}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_{\\mathcal E}\">\\(K_{\\mathcal E}\\)</span> 的判定器，先构造在判定器拒绝时接受、在其接受时发散的机器，再使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"db96cabedd089e5f\" href=\"?note=db96cabedd089e5f\" title=\"73-df-binary-program-coding\">73-df-binary-program-coding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DTMRenaming}_{\\mathbf2}\">\\(\\operatorname{DTMRenaming}_{\\mathbf2}\\)</span> 进行规范重命名。这个关系保持每条转移及接受、拒绝状态，因此保持停机与发散；仅凭语言相等不能完成此步。对规范机器的自身编码运行即得矛盾。</p>\n<p>对配对停机语言，先判定输入是否为合法机器码。非法码直接作为对角语言的否定实例处理；合法码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 送到显式可计算配对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,x\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\">\\(\\langle x,x\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\\)</span>。若配对停机可判定，则对角停机也可判定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-dtm-language-decision","status":"resolved","id":"004d4e2ba3fdd14e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-diagonal-halting","status":"resolved","id":"b9e8acd6d8438a5d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-diagonal-halting]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-paired-halting-language","status":"resolved","id":"c53aeda03b707867","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-paired-halting-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-binary-universal-machine","status":"resolved","id":"17b3325184317072","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-binary-universal-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-program-coding","status":"resolved","id":"db96cabedd089e5f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-program-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-language-decision","status":"resolved","id":"004d4e2ba3fdd14e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf 2}$ (decidable binary languages, see [[73-df-dtm-language-decision]])","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-program-coding","status":"resolved","id":"db96cabedd089e5f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"若存在 $K_{\\mathcal E}$ 的判定器，先构造在判定器拒绝时接受、在其接受时发散的机器，再使用 [[73-df-binary-program-coding]] 的 $\\operatorname{DTMRenaming}_{\\mathbf2}$ 进行规范重命名。这个关系保持每条转移及接受、拒绝状态，因此保持停机与发散；仅凭语言相等不能完成此步。对规范机器的自身编码运行即得矛盾。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"K_{\\mathcal E}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{HALT}_{\\mathcal E}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf 2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}halting\\text{-}undecidable}\\vdash\nK_{\\mathcal E}\\notin\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf 2}\n\\qquad\\land\\qquad\n\\mathsf{HALT}_{\\mathcal E}\\notin\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf 2}","display":true},{"tex":"K_{\\mathcal E}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DTMRenaming}_{\\mathbf2}","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle x,x\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}","display":false}],"bytes":1739,"backlinks":[{"id":"de1cd2013aed2d29","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["004d4e2ba3fdd14e","b9e8acd6d8438a5d","c53aeda03b707867","17b3325184317072","db96cabedd089e5f"]}